# Never uploaded, even if they reach the build: dotfiles (.env, .git, .DS_Store)
# and private keys. Next copies this file into out/ with the rest of public/;
# Wrangler reads it there and does not upload it. `npm run promote` refuses a
# build that holds any of them, too.
.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_dsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
